{"id":"apre_s","lemma":"après","pos":"prep","rank":110,"glosses":["after, later than in time.","after, coming for, trying to get (someone)."],"ipa":"/a.pʁɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/53/Fr-apr%C3%A8s.ogg/Fr-apr%C3%A8s.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Après vous.","en":"After you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39404","words":[null,{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Je suis libre après déjeuner.","en":"I'm free after lunch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103059","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"free, at liberty"},null,{"g":"to lunch"}]},{"text":"Venez après-demain.","en":"Come the day after tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Que veux-tu faire après ?","en":"What do you want to do next?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do"},null]},{"text":"Je ferai probablement ça après-demain.","en":"I'll probably do that the day after tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"probably"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]}]}